  "description": "The Subway model has it all, fully sealed bike with all the trimmings. Frame comes with removable brake hardware and is fully sealed throughout. Bigger bars, Pivotal Seat, top load stem and Chad Kerley's signature tires. The Subway is perfect for any style of riding, street, park and or dirt.\nPremium Cr-Mo downtube frame with integrated head tube, Mid BB shell and integrated seat clamp 20.5\" or 21\" top tube\nInternal threaded Cr-Mo steer tube fork with hi-ten tapered legs\n9\" rise 2-piece bars with Premium alloy top load stem\nPremium flangeless Team Grips.\nThree-piece Cr-Mo 175mm 8-spline cranks with sealed Mid BB\n25/9 gearing\n36 hole alloy single wall rims with sealed free-coaster rear hub\nPremium CK tires 2.4\" front and rear\nPremium Fat Capitol Pivotal seat with alloy Pivotal post.\nPremium Kinetic plastic pedals",
